<view class="page feature-page group-page"><brand-header back="{{true}}" title="社群拼团"></brand-header><view class="pad"><view wx:if="{{selectedGroup}}"><view class="group-status panel"><view class="group-status-icon"><ui-icon name="group" active="{{true}}" size="62"></ui-icon></view><view class="group-status-title">{{selectedGroup.status === '待成团' ? '邀请好友，一起成团' : selectedGroup.status === '已成团' ? '演示拼团成功' : '本次拼团已结束'}}</view><view class="muted">{{selectedGroup.status === '待成团' ? '还差 ' + selectedGroup.remaining + ' 人即可成团' : selectedGroup.status === '已成团' ? '已生成本地待付款演示订单' : '可以返回活动列表重新开团'}}</view><view class="group-members"><view class="group-member"><ui-icon name="user" active="{{true}}" size="44"></ui-icon><text>我</text></view><view class="group-member {{selectedGroup.target > selectedGroup.members ? 'waiting' : ''}}"><ui-icon name="{{selectedGroup.target > selectedGroup.members ? 'plus' : 'user'}}" size="44"></ui-icon><text>{{selectedGroup.target > selectedGroup.members ? '等好友' : '演示好友'}}</text></view></view><view class="group-item-name">{{selectedGroup.name}}</view><view class="campaign-deal-price"><text>¥</text>{{selectedGroup.displayPrice}}<text class="group-price-unit"> / 人</text></view><view class="card-note group-expiry">有效期至 {{selectedGroup.expiry}}</view><button wx:if="{{selectedGroup.status === '待成团'}}" class="primary-button group-invite" open-type="share">邀请好友参团</button><button wx:if="{{selectedGroup.status === '待成团'}}" class="secondary-button group-simulate" bindtap="simulate">模拟好友参团</button><button wx:if="{{selectedGroup.status === '已成团'}}" class="primary-button group-invite" bindtap="orders">查看演示订单</button></view><view class="notice">这是本地拼团演示，分享入口已预留，跨用户参团需要接入后台。点击“模拟好友参团”可验证成团流程，不会发起真实交易。</view></view><view wx:else><view class="feature-tabs"><button class="feature-tab {{tab === 'offers' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-tab="offers" bindtap="changeTab">精选拼团</button><button class="feature-tab {{tab === 'mine' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-tab="mine" bindtap="changeTab">我的拼团（{{groups.length}}）</button></view><view wx:if="{{tab === 'offers'}}"><view class="group-list-intro"><view>拼团价更优</view><text>邀请好友，一起参与美丽计划</text></view><view class="group-offer-card panel" wx:for="{{offers}}" wx:key="id"><button class="group-offer-product" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="viewOffer"><view class="group-offer-photo"><media-placeholder src="{{item.image}}" label="项目图片" fit="aspectFit" blank="{{true}}" kind="product"></media-placeholder></view><view class="group-offer-copy"><view class="group-offer-title">{{item.name}}</view><view class="group-offer-price-row"><text class="group-people-badge">{{item.members}}人团</text><text class="group-offer-price"><text>¥</text>{{item.displayPrice}}</text></view><view class="group-offer-joined">{{item.joined}}人已拼</view></view></button><view class="group-offer-bottom"><view class="group-offer-remaining"><text>距结束</text><text class="group-time-cell">{{countdown.days}}</text><text>天</text><text class="group-time-cell">{{countdown.hours}}</text><text>:</text><text class="group-time-cell">{{countdown.minutes}}</text><text>:</text><text class="group-time-cell">{{countdown.seconds}}</text></view><button class="primary-button group-open-button" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="viewOffer" disabled="{{countdown.ended}}">{{countdown.ended ? '已结束' : '去开团'}}</button></view></view></view><view wx:else><button class="panel group-record" wx:for="{{groups}}" wx:key="id" bindtap="openGroup" data-id="{{item.id}}"><view class="between"><text class="group-record-name">{{item.name}}</text><text class="pill">{{item.status}}</text></view><view class="between group-record-meta"><text>{{item.members}}/{{item.target}} 人 · ¥{{item.displayPrice}}/人</text><ui-icon name="chevron" size="24"></ui-icon></view></button><view class="empty" wx:if="{{!groups.length}}"><view class="empty-title">还没有拼团记录</view><text>选择喜欢的项目，开启一次拼团体验</text></view></view><view class="notice">商品、已拼人数及参与者为示例资料，图片继续留空。当前为本地拼团演示，不发起真实交易。</view></view></view></view>
